              Quarterly Report

SUMMARY
=======

Revenue  grew  in every region this quarter,
led  by  strong  demand  for the new product
line.  Costs  rose more slowly than revenue,
so the margin improved.






                page 1 of 4
              Quarterly Report

REGIONAL RESULTS
================

1. North:  sales  up  twelve  percent on the
   back of two large contracts.
2. South:  flat, as expected after the price
   change in the spring.

  - Retail held steady.
  - Wholesale fell slightly.



                page 2 of 4
              Quarterly Report

3. East: the new office opened in May and is
   already profitable.

OUTLOOK
=======

We expect the next quarter to be similar,
with some risk from currency movements and
the timing of the remaining contracts.




